# Every text file is CRLF in the working tree, on every platform, and LF in the index, whatever core.autocrlf says.
# The Content-Security-Policy hashes in hn_polarization.html do not depend on this: the browser converts CRLF to
# LF while parsing the page, before it hashes an inline block, and scripts/csp.js hashes the same LF text.
* text=auto eol=crlf
